  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/655/655-46.htm",
  "statuteText": "655:46 Withdrawal. –\n\nWhere a nomination has been made according to this chapter, no withdrawal or declination of a candidate shall be accepted by the secretary of state except as provided in RSA 655:38."
